SUMMARY:Dracula: A Comedy of Terrors
DESCRIPTION:Just in time for spooky season\, Bram Stoker’s classic gets a hilariously ridiculous makeover by writers Gordon Greenberg and Steve Rosen! Packed with clever wit\, lightning-fast costume changes\, and side-splitting twists\, Dracula: A Comedy of Terrors is a madcap romp through the world of the undead—where nothing is sacred\, everything is up for laughs\, and the stakes (pun intended) have never been higher.
URL:https://unitedarts.org/calendar/dracula-a-comedy-of-terrors/2026-10-31/
LOCATION:De Ann S. Jones Theatre at Theatre Raleigh Arts Center\, 6638 Old Wake Forest Road\, Raleigh
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://unitedarts.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/draculaeventsquare.png
